<title>ITALY: Italy pension spending in line with budget - INPS. [corrected 15:47 gmt]</title>
<headline>Italy pension spending in line with budget - INPS. [corrected 15:47 gmt]</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's pension spending in 1997 is in line with forecast, Gianni Billia, the president of state pensions body INPs, told reporters on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;In the first four months of the year pension spending has been in line with forecasts. Infact on spending of around 55 trillion lire there has been an overshoot of only 31 billion,&quot; Billia said in a statement. (Corrects second paragraph following the release of an INPs statement clarifying Billia's original remarks.)</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +396 6782501</p>
</text>
